ta-deferred="1" class="ns3CYe" alt="Item media 3 (screenshot) for Salesforge: Free B2B Email &amp; Phone Number Finder"></div><span class="B2BZvc"></span><span class="XjoK4b MLAFhd"></span></div><div class="jkL06e" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Preview slide 4 for Salesforge: Free B2B Email &amp; Phone Number Finder" data-index="3" jsaction="click:FixwAe"><div jsname="j8Rbke" data-media-url="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/M5ppOPWZGAxAv_wXRLbROekx4fE2x8lzYf_4Zb1526K2IT-OlaT9EPraRZHuJ_tWOSwhK_Erm9rx2o7ULVL_JMuF" data-is-video="false" data-slide-index="3" class="UeyHFf" inert><img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///////yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-iid="i14" data-deferred="1" class="ns3CYe" alt="Item media 4 (screenshot) for Salesforge: Free B2B Email &amp; Phone Number Finder"></div><span class="B2BZvc"></span><span class="XjoK4b MLAFhd"></span></div><div class="jkL06e" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Preview slide 5 for Salesforge: Free B2B Email &amp; Phone Number Finder" data-index="4" jsaction="click:FixwAe"><div jsname="j8Rbke" data-media-url="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/g7u5WLNPU7cFnMii_FWOJ7KLPqJSRhlC92Ys0puqGfuIzrNGswHhc5i0Eiv4JW9-VkF-VtVUE6XDhTdsfpEVfY2MOQ" data-is-video="false" data-slide-index="4" class="UeyHFf" inert><img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///////yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" data-iid="i15" data-deferred="1" class="ns3CYe" alt="Item media 5 (screenshot) for Salesforge: Free B2B Email &amp; Phone Number Finder"></div><span class="B2BZvc"></span><span class="XjoK4b MLAFhd"></span></div></div></section><section class="MHH2Z"><div class="SmeJW"><h2 class="p9xg1"><div>Overview</div></h2></div><div class="p5TRec" jscontroller="Tl2FDf" jsaction="click:i7GaQb(rs1XOd);rcuQ6b:npT2md"><div jsname="ij8cu" class="mN52G oB8Rd"><p>Capture contacts, send personalized emails or messages, and sync contacts into your outreach pipeline in one click.</p><p>Salesforge extension helps you find contact info, add prospects to your pipeline, launch personalized outreach, and speed up your entire prospecting workflow.

Prospecting shouldn’t take hours. With Salesforge, you can capture a lead’s business email or phone number instantly, enrich profiles, send tailored messages, and sync everything directly into your Salesforge account with a single click.

Built for modern outbound teams, the extension works wherever you work - LinkedIn, company websites - turning every page into a prospecting surface.

Install the free extension, or unlock the full Salesforge platform (AI SDR, multi-channel outreach, deliverability tools, lead search, and more) with a free account at: https://salesforge.ai

Thousands of founders, SDRs, and agencies use Salesforge to streamline contact discovery and automate their outreach.

🔥 Prospect faster - anywhere you work
Use the Salesforge Chrome Extension to do all of the below across tools you already use every day, including LinkedIn, company websites, and inside your Salesforge workspace:
- Find verified B2B emails
- Find mobile phone numbers
- Capture contacts from any page
- Launch personalized emails instantly
- Tag contacts
- Sync contacts directly into your Salesforge pipeline
- Trigger outreach sequences
- Compose emails with AI
- Build lead lists as you browse
- Save prospects without switching tabs
With one click, Salesforge turns manual research into a streamlined workflow.

🚀 Additional platform-specific features
The Chrome Extension is optimized for each workflow you work in - giving you even more power inside each platform.
LinkedIn
- Capture contact emails &amp; phones from profiles
- Save leads directly into Salesforge
- Build lists while browsing
- Enrich contacts with company info
Company Websites
- Instantly discover decision-maker contact details
- Add prospects to your pipeline
- Launch outreach without opening another tool
Everywhere Online
- Open the Salesforge sidebar on any site
- Pull verified contact info in seconds
- Sync everything seamlessly to your CRM inside Salesforge

🤝 Extension benefits
- The Salesforge Chrome Extension includes:
- Free Unlimited contact lookups
- Free Unlimited contact saving
- Free syncing to your Salesforge pipeline
- AI-assisted email writing inside Salesforge
- Free warm-up (via Warmforge) for mailboxes connected to Salesforge
- Access to Salesforge’s free tools: Spam Checker, Blacklist Checker, DMARC Record Generator &amp; more
Salesforge’s free tier delivers high value out of the box - no complicated setup, no hidden restrictions.
Explore additional capabilities with full access to the Salesforge platform: https://salesforge.ai

🌐 Useful links
LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/salesforgeai
Website: https://salesforge.ai
Help Center: https://help.salesforge.ai
Blog: https://salesforge.ai/blog
